{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "wsm6_couple_rescale_inputs",
  "description": "Mount-edge library of the WSM6 microphysics-step assembly (couplings/microphysics_column*.esm): lowers the `input_<x>` rewrite targets of WSM6MassConservation to the additive coupling-target parameters `<x>_in`, which the document's variable_map param_to_var edges fill from the upstream stage (esm-spec 9.7.10 + 10.4). Hand-authored; no numbers. The whole input set is coupled except the vapor mixing ratio, which the rate stages do not change: the state from WSM6MeltingFreezing, xl and cpm from WSM6Saturation, and the 22 raw process rates from WSM6WarmRain (3), WSM6ColdAccretion (11) and WSM6IceDeposition (8).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "assembly-inputs",
   "coupling"
  ]
 },
